      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-97240",
      ":question/problem": "In a shipment of eggs, each egg has a $15%$ chance of being cracked. A supermarket employee is asked to inspect the eggs until they find $3$ broken ones. What is the probability that the employee will find the $3$rd broken egg on the $20$th egg they inspect? Round your answer to $4$ decimal places.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
